flowchart LR
    ASK[Agent answer / tool result] --> DETECT{Explicit write request?}
    DETECT -->|No| READ_ONLY[Return information only]
    DETECT -->|Yes| DRAFT[Create action draft]
    DRAFT --> VALIDATE[Validate required fields\ntime + title + scope]
    VALIDATE --> MISSING{Missing or ambiguous?}
    MISSING -->|Yes| CLARIFY[Ask clarification\nno side effect]
    MISSING -->|No| PREVIEW[Preview action\napproval required]
    PREVIEW --> USER[User reviews / confirms]
    USER --> APPROVAL{Approved?}
    APPROVAL -->|No| CANCEL[Cancel draft]
    APPROVAL -->|Yes| IDEMPOTENCY[Check idempotency key]
    IDEMPOTENCY --> WRITE[Perform external write]
    WRITE -->|Task| TASK[(tasks)]
    WRITE -->|Calendar| CAL[(calendar_operations)]
    WRITE --> AUDIT[(audit_events)]
    WRITE --> CONFIRM[Confirmation response]
    TASK --> CONFIRM
    CAL --> CONFIRM
    CONFIRM --> CHAT[(conversation_messages)]
    WRITE --> ERROR{Provider error?}
    ERROR -->|Yes| SAFE_ERROR[Sanitized failure\nkeep draft retryable]
    ERROR -->|No| CONFIRM

    classDef input fill:#E8F3FF,stroke:#2774AE,color:#102A43;
    classDef process fill:#FFF4D6,stroke:#B7791F,color:#4A3200;
    classDef approval fill:#FCE8F3,stroke:#B83280,color:#4A1632;
    classDef data fill:#E9F7EF,stroke:#238636,color:#123524;
    class ASK,USER input;
    class DETECT,DRAFT,VALIDATE,MISSING,CLARIFY,PREVIEW,IDEMPOTENCY,WRITE,ERROR,SAFE_ERROR,READ_ONLY,CANCEL,CONFIRM process;
    class APPROVAL approval;
    class TASK,CAL,AUDIT,CHAT data;
